      "notation": "untainted-checker",
      "description": "Re-executes a SAMPLE of a plan's cases from the plan and the data alone — never the tester's verdicts — and reports whether it agrees. It rules on nothing: agreement is a fact the certification table reads, not a verdict the checker writes (`untainted-verification` rule 3: one party doing both halves is not this check). Lane `Lane_Checker` in `test-plan-execution.bpmn`, bean `3o5b`.",
